    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70375f9c32987a5ae16ca834",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是这一带，没错。炎症复发了。\n不过轻微到了让我觉得您竟能察觉实在难得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c2edfcc613d0ec6930df7bd1b436b490c7d2ba0e04f764efff5ec8bfa4aa069",
