    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5513eeff785020eb7759e600",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一般情况下不必在意……\n但既然是复发就另当别论了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5842a5f9b68519e9ceb59280d30eedd1fdbf8fd08643c5ce44e97fc4d1c0a1b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25d1ccfa64bcbbe4ab4ec23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但是，那孩子接下来――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2312292d8c2d5a1efe6124886eabeedc6bfdfec38812739759976c9d9fd7fef0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110116.json",
